dgdtdo alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Decaf gets the leftover treatment—coffee companies dump their oldest, stalest beans into the decaf pile. Why waste fresh beans on caffeine-free customers? It's pure profit math at your taste buds' expense.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="afe2a629-4a5a-4881-9b92-5419286426d7" class="r-84cpf2"><picture data-rid="6babb325-461a-4b11-8c0f-497b463921ae" class="r-vclhdz"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/3215a1c1-368d-4034-97ce-8acfde524427/6da6a642-8f64-46e2-b87d-a3e59e1be09c?width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/3215a1c1-368d-4034-97ce-8acfde524427/6da6a642-8f64-46e2-b87d-a3e59e1be09c?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/3215a1c1-368d-4034-97ce-8acfde524427/6da6a642-8f64-46e2-b87d-a3e59e1be09c?width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/3215a1c1-368d-4034-97ce-8acfde524427/6da6a642-8f64-46e2-b87d-a3e59e1be09c" class="r-9y71l" loading="lazy"/></picture><div data-rid="9ccfaa16-1a3c-4ddb-a5eb-f66445db61e2" class="r-1qq77fq"><div data-rid="2b8c707c-e097-49a4-ba70-894d576685f4" class="r-x7ytps"><div data-rid="dcc6ffff-ef9e-4463-9456-6a334f8561c5" class="r-1fwq969"><picture data-rid="00a6c05a-5ff1-4fb7-9d9a-e11b933c3d8a" class="r-gcs6r7"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/3215a1c1-368d-4034-97ce-8acfde524427/2bf89557-6503-4d07-9440-2c6bbeb4d983?width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/3215a1c1-368d-4034-97ce-8acfde524427/2bf89557-6503-4d07-9440-2c6bbeb4d983?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/3215a1c1-368d-4034-97ce-8acfde524427/2bf89557-6503-4d07-9440-2c6bbeb4d983?width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://as